message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Composition of Attributed Risk in Stunting Across Developmental Stages"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for measuring how the composition of attributed risk in stunting
  differs between two developmental stages, using three Indonesian national surveys
  (SSGI 2022, SSGI 2024, SKI 2023). Domain attribution shares are computed from Shapley
  values and compared across stages. Machine learning is used as a measurement
  instrument rather than as a predictor.
